#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file encryptionconfigurationdialog.ui line 379
#: rc.cpp:257
msgid "Check to have encrypted messages also encrypted using your own key."
msgstr ""
"Тамоми иттилоотҳои рамзгузошташударо ҳамчунин бо калиди худ рамзгузорӣ "
"кардан."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file encryptionconfigurationdialog.ui line 387
#: rc.cpp:260
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Always encrypt to self</h1>\n"
"If this box is checked, encrypted messages sent by you will also be "
"encrypted using your own key.\n"
"<p>\n"
"It is recommended to leave this option turned on to enable you to read the "
